#: ../../tools/dryad_tools.rst:63 b2b42ec32ef444c0a15b24f99b2a3c48
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the list of downloadable files for a specific Dryad "
"dataset version. Returns file names, sizes, MIME types, and MD5 checksums"
" for each file in the dataset. The version\\_id can be found in the "
"Dryad\\_get\\_dataset response under \\_links.stash:version.href (extract"
" the numeric ID from the path, e.g., '/api/v2/versions/124910' means "
"version\\_id=124910). Use this to discover what data files are available "
"before downloading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/dryad_tools.rst:67 6d3f3c87f71c4cb38f37019a74f9e2bc
msgid ""
"``version_id`` (integer) (required) Version ID from Dryad dataset "
"metadata. Found in \\_links.stash:version.href of Dryad\\_get\\_dataset "
"response (e.g., 124910, 94, 93)."
msgstr ""

